  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder, turmeric, and cumin and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the crushed datterini tomatoes and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the coconut milk and stir well.",
    "Add the salt and black pepper and stir well.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the curry for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with naan bread."
